{"version":1,"id":"tate-mcrae-you-broke-me-first","title":"You Broke Me First","artist":"Tate McRae","key":"E","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/tate-mcrae/you-broke-me-first/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Blake Preston Harnage, Victoria Ryann Zaro and Tate Mcrae","chords":[{"symbol":"C#m","canonical":"C#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":14,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":13,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"You broke me first","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Maybe you don't like talking too much about yourself","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"But you should have told me","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"That you were thinking 'bout someone else","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"You're drunk at a party","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Or maybe it's just that your car broke down","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":29,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Or your phone's been off for a couple of months","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"So you're calling me now","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"  I know you, you're like this","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"When shit don't go your way you needed me to fix it","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"  And like me, I did","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"But I ran out of every reason","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Now suddenly you're asking for it back","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":20,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"Could you tell me, where'd you get the nerve?","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Yeah, you could say you miss all that we had","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":24,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"But I don't really care how bad it hurts","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":40,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"When you broke me first","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"You broke me first","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Took a while, was in denial when I first heard","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"That you moved on quicker than I could've ever","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"You know that hurt","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Swear, for a while I would stare at my phone","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Just to see your name","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"But now that it's there, I don't really know what to say","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"  I know you, you're like this","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"When shit don't go your way you needed me to fix it","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"  And like me, I did","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":17,"beat":